Pullback -- pullback in the category of rings
*********************************************

Description
===========

Pullback is a package that implements pullback for diagrams of rings

Caveat
======

Works only for maps of rings finitely generated over a base field and one of
the two maps is surjective

Authors
=======

  * Drew Ellingson
  * Karl Schwede

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 1.03 of Pullback, released March 8, 2018.

